{"projectInfo":{"name":"GRE over IPv4隧道配置举例","path":"gre_static","visibility":2,"categoryId":35,"introduction":"Router A和Router B分别连接IPv4私有网络Group 1和Group 2。这两个私有网络都使用私网地址，且属于同一个VPN。通过在Router A和Router B之间建立GRE隧道，实现两个私有网络的互联。","label":["GRE","隧道"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"Internet","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Internet.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTA","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTB","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTB.cfg"}]}